---
title: "Demo 2: Token sync"
layout: "base.njk"
templateEngineOverride: njk
description: Claude classifies design token changes from Figma
permalink: /talks/acme-talk/demo-2/
---
{% include "talks-style.njk" %}
<div class="fade-in talk">
    <p><a href="/talks/acme-talk/">← Talk hub</a></p>
    <h1>Demo 2: Token sync</h1>
    <p class="muted">A scripted sync diffs the Figma export; Claude Code classifies each change. Overall bump: <strong>{{ acmeTalk.sync.overall_semver }}</strong>.</p>
    <table class="stack">
        <thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Tokens</th><th>Semver</th><th>Breaking</th><th>Rationale</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for c in acmeTalk.sync.changes %}
            <tr>
                <td data-label="Change">{{ c.change_type }}{% if c.to %}<br><code>→ {{ c.to }}</code>{% endif %}</td>
                <td data-label="Tokens">{% for t in c.tokens %}<code>{{ t }}</code><br>{% endfor %}</td>
                <td data-label="Semver">{{ c.semver }}</td>
                <td data-label="Breaking">{{ "yes" if c.is_breaking else "no" }}</td>
                <td data-label="Rationale">{{ c.rationale }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <h2>Generated changelog</h2>
    <pre>{{ acmeTalk.sync.changelog_md }}</pre>
    <h2>Migration notes</h2>
    <pre>{{ acmeTalk.sync.migration_notes_md }}</pre>
</div>
